    <comment>Update to 1.18.25

Azure Entra ID sign-in via Azure CLI, Bedrock unreplayable reasoning
blocks dropped before caching, v2 config fields read in v1, migration
history recovery for older local databases.

Vendor sources regenerated: dependency closure unchanged (upstream root
package.json byte-identical to 1.18.23, bun.lock delta confined to
packages/console which the filtered install skips). Licence set unchanged
over 509 packages, no copyleft. Green on aarch64 and x86_64.</comment>
